    'Routes a consent-forward kink communication guide into trust, timing, listening, pacing, and check-in categories.',
    'Use this source as relationship communication scaffolding. The useful sequence is simple: check whether disclosure is safe, choose a private nonsexual time, invite a two-way conversation, name one or two desires without demanding agreement, listen without shaming, repeat back meaning, identify the smallest comfortable next step, and keep checking in before, during, and after. The prose should feel adult and human: less workshop script, more two people learning how to stay honest without cornering each other.',
