    'Kink vocabulary is not universal. One person may mean playful swat, another may mean formal impact scene; one may mean costume roleplay, another may mean power exchange. Use curiosity, repeatback, and term alignment before escalation. The scene beats are small but useful: asking what the word means to them, naming what you heard, noticing tone, checking whether the question feels curious or judgmental, and leaving space for correction without punishment.',
