    'Resolution New Equilibrium Map',
    'resolution-new-equilibrium-map',
    'Ending taxonomy',
    'Builds aftermath, closure, relationship outcome, thematic validation, and final image into endings.',
    'After the big action, let the consequences land. Answer the story question, settle the relationship or show why it cannot settle, reveal the antagonist or rival''s fate, prove the thematic argument through changed behavior, and show the new everyday world. The final image should carry the emotional aftertaste: home restored, home changed, no home left, or a door left open with intent.',
