    'Plot Symmetry Continuity Map',
    'plot-symmetry-continuity-map',
    'Continuity taxonomy',
    'Uses echoes, mirrored choices, repeated motifs, and series constraints to keep long arcs cohesive.',
    'For continuity work, look for an earlier pressure that the later scene can answer. Mirror the inciting challenge in the final choice. Let a line, place, role, gesture, or image return with altered meaning. In a series, resolve the current arc cleanly while preserving the pieces the next story needs: core cast, recurring locations, unresolved long arcs, and emotional questions that feel alive rather than neglected.',
