  ),
  (
    'core-integral-conflict-axis-map',
    'Integral Conflict Axis Map',
    'integral-conflict-axis-map',
    'Scene craft taxonomy',
    'Classifies opposition by directness, activity, motive, and relationship to the goal.',
    'Conflict should not be random noise. Sort the opposition: direct or indirect, active or passive, external or internal, physical or emotional, information lack or physical lack, verbal clash or practical obstacle. Then test it: does it grow from the goal, does the opposing force have a logical motive, does it threaten what the character wants, and does the outcome create a real next problem? A quiet avoidance can be as strong as a fight when it blocks the right door.',
    array[
      'integral-conflict-opposition',
      'active-passive-conflict-axis',
      'scene-development-complication',
      'internal-external-conflict-braid',
      'psych-conflict-repair',
