    'Boostyle Trait Specificity Map',
    'boostyle-trait-specificity-map',
    'Prompt architecture taxonomy',
    'Converts single-word traits into compact, specific clauses the model can actually use.',
    'Avoid bare labels when the card needs behavior. "Stubborn" is weaker than "refuses to go out when a plan feels unsafe." "Dislikes games" is weaker than "avoids video games because an old accident made consoles feel threatening." Keep plus-separated traits short, concrete, and nonredundant. Each clause should answer what the character does, when it appears, and why it matters in scene.',
