    'Body Variability and Limits',
    'body-variability-and-limits',
    'Physical reference',
    'Keeps bodies specific through stamina, comfort, flexibility, strength, sensitivity, soreness, fatigue, and constraints.',
    'Bodies vary. Track strength, flexibility, reach, stamina, sensitivity, arousal response, pain threshold, balance, injury, clothing, environment, and fatigue. If a position, technique, restraint, or transition is physically demanding, show support points, adjustments, strain, breath, cramping, slipping, laughter, awkward logistics, or the need to slow down. Realism should add friction and specificity, not flatten erotic intensity.',
