    'Routes romantic-comedy arc craft into two-lead transformation, limiting belief, wound, mask, and relationship-barrier maps.',
    'Use this source when a romance or romcom needs emotional architecture. Track four moving parts: the romance relationship, each lead''s arc, and the external plot spine. For each lead, define ordinary-world protection, limiting belief, wound, mask, longing, need, fear, and short-term goal. Then ask how the love interest pressures the exact belief that makes love feel unsafe. The romance should change behavior, not merely reward attraction.',
    array[
      'romcom-character-arcs-source',
      'romance-four-track-structure',
