  ),
  (
    'core-limiting-belief-romance-profile-map',
    'Limiting Belief Romance Profile Map',
    'limiting-belief-romance-profile-map',
    'Character arc taxonomy',
    'Builds each romantic lead from goal, longing, need, wound, mask, essence, belief, and deep fear.',
    'For each lead, profile the pressure beneath the charm. Short-term goal gives the plot motion. Longing names the desire they have not dared pursue. Need names what would make life whole. Wound explains the pain. Mask shows the public strategy. Essence names who they are without the mask. Core belief explains the rules they think keep them safe. Deep fear names what love might reopen. The relationship barrier emerges when that fear meets the other lead.',
