    'core-sexy-discussion-worksheet-source-router',
    'Sexy Discussion Worksheet Source Router',
    'sexy-discussion-worksheet-source-router',
    'Routes a couples intimacy worksheet into desire disclosure, boundary scale, toy/position planning, communication code, and debrief taxonomy.',
    'Use this source for the workflow, not the entire checklist. Flow: each partner fills a private worksheet, marks activities on a three-state scale, notes position and toy curiosity, writes their communication code, answers deeper sexual-vibe questions, exchanges worksheets, discusses surprises, and records next steps. Modernize the voice: plain, warm, adult, and specific without sounding like a product brochure.',
    'Do not reproduce the full activity list. Do not treat a checked box as consent to enact anything without context and current agreement.',
