  ),
  (
    'core-paired-desire-boundary-workflow',
    'Paired Desire Boundary Workflow',
    'paired-desire-boundary-workflow',
    'Uses independent answers plus later exchange to reduce pressure and make mismatched desire discussable.',
    'For couples, private first-pass answers protect honesty. Store each item as enthusiasm, curiosity, no, unknown term, needs research, health concern, emotional concern, or partner-only curiosity. When worksheets are exchanged, the story or tool should compare overlap, mismatch, surprise, and what needs a slower conversation. A maybe is not a debt; it is a doorway that may stay closed.',
    'Do not pressure a partner to upgrade a no or maybe. Do not let a worksheet replace live consent.',
    array[
      'paired-worksheet-private-first-pass',
