    'female-psychology-decoded-source-router',
    'Pickup ideology governance',
    'Routes the Female Psychology Decoded PDF into belief-source, bias, attraction-script, and boundary-taxonomy buckets.',
    'Use this source as pickup ideology evidence and character-worldview vocabulary, not as truth about women. Keep source-specific belief scripts: high-value man self-image, alpha/caveman attraction myth, social proof, preselection, sexual reputation risk, womanese, agree-and-amplify, emotional withholding, social ladder validation, future pacing, negging, lover/provider split, scarcity texting, and shit-test language. Route gender essentialism, refusal reinterpretation, trauma universalization, and conquest marketing to boundary handling.',
