    'Belief-source character taxonomy',
    'Maps high-value man, alpha, mission, purpose, dominance, and superiority scripts as self-image fuel.',
    'For character work, a high-value script can explain posture, pride, discipline, isolation, contempt, ambition, or a fragile need to stay above other men. Store the self-talk separately from truth. Useful beats include repeating a mantra, calling others sheep, ranking women, pursuing mission over intimacy, rejecting comfort, performing certainty, and fearing that softness will cost status.',
