    'Attraction belief-source taxonomy',
    'Routes social proof, preselection, venue status, money-status claims, and social ladder validation as attraction scripts.',
    'Social proof scripts can be useful as a character belief about attention economies. Track who is watching, whose approval matters, what status signal is being staged, and what insecurity it tries to solve. Signals may include other women nearby, social media photos, staff treating someone well, money display, peer approval, being busy, or seeming wanted elsewhere. Do not treat staged proof as consent or actual compatibility.',
