    'Quarantines claims about female subcommunication, tests, emotional logic, and indirect refusal.',
    'When a source says women speak in womanese, tests, emotional sequences, or indirect subcommunication, classify it as belief-source. A character may believe every objection is a test, every no means plausible deniability, and every body cue reveals hidden desire. The safer system route is slower: treat words as meaningful, check context, do not override refusal, and distinguish playful banter from discomfort, fear, or social self-protection.',
