    'Routes the Reedsy exercise source into character, dialogue, plot, outlining, POV, and theme prompt scaffolds.',
    'Use this source as craft scaffolding, not as fill-in-the-blank biography bloat. Extract reusable exercise shapes: define the past event, ask why until motive appears, separate want from need, give the character lumpy visible habits, test behavior across social contexts, shift POV, let reputation distort the person, force a moral dilemma, reveal priority in crisis, and keep every scene attached to a question or turn.',
    array[
      'reedsy-developmental-exercise-source',
