  ),
  (
    'core-character-history-want-need-map',
    'Character History Want Need Map',
    'character-history-want-need-map',
    'Character development taxonomy',
    'Builds character motive from defining moment, fear, desire, weakness, sacrifice, family context, and the want/need split.',
    'Start character development with pressure, not trivia. Store the defining moment, family dynamic, class or place history, happiest and worst memories, fear, desire, weakness, coping style, relationship history, and what they would change about the past. Then separate want from need: what the character chases, what the chase protects, what it costs, and what would force them to change.',
    array[
      'character-history-defining-moment',
      'want-need-desire-axis',
      'why-ladder-character-causality',
      'psych-character-flaw',
      'moral-dilemma-catalyst-change',
      'theme-scene-pressure'
