      'mundane-errand-character-engine',
      'crisis-object-reveal',
      'public-interview-character-reveal',
      'letter-younger-self-regret',
      'playable-handoff'
    ],
    array['JanitorAI', 'SillyTavern', 'MarinaraTavern']
  ),
  (
    'core-dialogue-voice-observation-drill-map',
    'Dialogue Voice Observation Drill Map',
    'dialogue-voice-observation-drill-map',
    'Dialogue and voice taxonomy',
    'Groups imitation, unique diction, outsider observation, lottery-news reveals, gossip dialogue, and dialogue-only drills.',
    'Dialogue exercises should sharpen voice, not make everyone clever. Practice by imitating a voice, then translating back into your own. Give three characters the same news and track different word choice, timing, posture, and what each hides. Observe a conversation from too far away to hear it and infer the exchange from body language. In revision, cut lines that only explain what the action already says.',
    array[
