    array['JanitorAI', 'SillyTavern', 'MarinaraTavern']
  ),
  (
    'core-plot-question-branch-engine-map',
    'Plot Question Branch Engine Map',
    'plot-question-branch-engine-map',
    'Plot development taxonomy',
    'Keeps plot movement tied to questions, alternate decisions, hooks, clue trails, and scene turns.',
    'For plot development, name the question driving the whole work and the smaller question driving each scene. Then test branch points: what if the character chooses differently, what clue makes the twist fair, what forbidden act creates tension, what hook appears in the first paragraph, and what scene purpose changes the reader''s understanding? If no question changes, the scene may be atmosphere rather than plot.',
    array[
