    'Build motifs from character and theme together. List images tied to the theme, then list images tied to each major character. Reuse objects, weather, colors, gestures, songs, places, or textures when they make a decision heavier. A symbol should not float above the plot; it should return at a cost, change meaning, or expose a character''s relationship to the theme.',
