    'Use misplaced-politeness routing when a character stays because leaving feels rude, accepts intimacy to avoid awkwardness, keeps a confidence that should be named, lets flirting become privacy, or makes someone else''s comfort more important than the agreement they already made. The beat should stay concrete: the extra drink, the closed door, the ride home, the late reply, the hand not withdrawn, the excuse rehearsed afterward.',
