    'rehor-kink-women-survey-router',
    'Kink research',
    'Routes the adult women kink-community survey into usable category axes with nonclinical and sampling caveats.',
    'Use this source to widen kink taxonomy without turning one survey into universal truth. Capture the adult, community-based, nonclinical frame; the behavior groups; the doing/done/observing axis; and the finding that many participants reported broad, self-directed interest. Attach caveats: online survey, nonrandom recruitment, subjective terms, category overlap, no intensity scale, no generalization to all women, and no proof of any individual person''s desire.',
    array[
      'rehor-kink-women-source',
      'kink-community-nonclinical-sample',
