    'Kink taxonomy',
    'Converts the study categories into flexible routing axes for adult fictional behavior tagging.',
    'Classify kink behavior by multiple axes rather than one fixed label: physical sensation, psychological stimulus, power exchange, bondage/restraint, roleplay, exhibition/voyeurism, erotica/media, fetish object, overt sex act, group dynamic, professional context, health/safety risk, and blocked content. A single act may sit in several buckets. Preserve overlap instead of forcing false precision; that overlap is often where character motive and scene tension live.',
