    'Keeps fantasy scenarios, scene roles, relationship identities, and ongoing power exchange distinct.',
    'Do not flatten roleplay into identity or identity into costume. Track whether the material is a one-scene fantasy, a repeated scenario, a relationship agreement, a self-label, a community role, or a 24/7 structure. Authority scenes, danger fantasy, service roles, occupation play, animal roleplay, and caretaker frames all need adult consent, framing, exit routes, and aftermath. A role can be erotic theater, private truth, negotiated structure, or all three.',
