    'Erotic charge may come from doing, receiving, watching, being watched, imagining, remembering, photographing, sharing, performing, or simply knowing a scene is possible. Keep these distinct. Observation is not consent to participate, fantasy is not consent to enact, and a one-time experiment is not a stable preference. In character work, this axis creates nuance: curiosity, envy, fear, arousal, caution, refusal, pride, and the private line between wanting to see and wanting to touch.',
