    'When kink material involves paid or professional participation, do not automatically strip it from the human data. Track the role: performer, model, pro dominant, pro submissive, sex worker, site owner, educator, porn actor, or webcam worker. Then separate labor, desire, community belonging, consent, stigma, safety, income, boundaries, and private pleasure. Professional context can shape power and risk without erasing agency or turning work into proof of personal availability.',
