    'dirty-slang-dictionary-source-router',
    'NSFW taxonomy',
    'Routes a rough slang dictionary into adult vocabulary, register, health, identity, commerce, kink, and blocked-content buckets.',
    'Use this source as a slang triage layer, not a style guide. Sort each term by canonical meaning, anatomy or act bucket, register, identity impact, consent sensitivity, health risk, platform suitability, and allowed use. Keep useful contemporary wording lean and direct; mark dated, violent, misogynistic, animal-coded, coercive, or slur-like entries as context-only or blocked. Treat the source as evidence of what language exists in culture, not as endorsement or truth.',
    array[
      'dirty-slang-dictionary-source',
