  ),
  (
    'core-offensive-sexual-slang-boundary-map',
    'Offensive Sexual Slang Boundary Map',
    'offensive-sexual-slang-boundary-map',
    'Content boundary',
    'Separates offensive sexual slang into character-voice, context-only, and blocked-use routes.',
    'When slang carries humiliation, violence, misogyny, slur energy, or coercive joking, treat it as a boundary problem before treating it as diction. Ask what the term does: insults a body, targets an identity, mocks consent, implies force, turns risk into a joke, or degrades someone inside a negotiated scene. Generation-safe use requires adult consent, clear fictional frame, character fit, and consequences. Otherwise keep it as detection metadata or refuse the route.',
    array[
      'offensive-sexual-slang-boundary',
      'fluid-humiliation-slang-boundary',
      'misogynistic-body-insult-register',
      'nsfw-consent-boundary-risk',
      'offensive-language-taxonomy',
