    'High Risk Slang Blocked Router',
    'high-risk-slang-blocked-router',
    'Content boundary',
    'Routes unsafe slang for animal content, coercive acts, violent pranks, public harm, health risk, and illegal content away from generation.',
    'Some slang dictionaries flatten danger into jokes. Do not. Terms involving animals, minors, real assault, coercion, incapacitation, violence, STI exposure, forced public humiliation, or instructions for harm are safety metadata only. Store the term class, harm vector, consent failure, and blocked reason. For adult fictional kink, keep only negotiated, legal, consent-aware equivalents and require boundaries, aftercare, and consequence-aware framing.',
    array[
      'animal-content-slang-blocked',
      'barebacking-health-risk-slang',
      'nsfw-blocked-illegal-content',
      'nsfw-consent-boundary-risk',
      'consent-risk-blocked-taxonomy',
