  (
    'core-identity-slur-register-caveat-map',
    'Identity Slur Register Caveat Map',
    'identity-slur-register-caveat-map',
    'Identity taxonomy',
    'Handles queer-coded, gendered, body-shaming, and identity-targeted slang as belief-source evidence and register risk.',
    'Identity-targeted slang needs provenance and caution. Record whether a term is derogatory, reclaimed, dated, community-specific, misogynistic, transphobic, homophobic, body-shaming, porn-coded, or simply descriptive in a narrow context. Do not normalize slurs as neutral labels. In fiction, such language can show prejudice, self-protection, shame, power, intimacy, or social threat, but it should remain bounded by character, context, and consequence.',
    array[
      'identity-slur-queer-register-caveat',
      'nsfw-derogatory-slur-register',
      'offensive-language-taxonomy',
      'gender-courtesy-identity-respect',
      'identity-relationship-matrix',
