    'For any new character, answer three questions in scene terms. Want: what are they chasing hard enough to make trouble? Fear: what future, exposure, loss, or inner truth makes them act badly? Memorable trait: what visible habit, behavior, object, rhythm, or contradiction makes them hard to blur with the rest of the cast? The trait should carry dramatic meaning, not just color.',
