    'Character background taxonomy',
    'Routes RPG background material into persona scaffolds, archetype banks, social access hooks, and flaw pressure.',
    'Use this source as a character-background generator, not a rules source. Extract the durable structure: origin role, former institution, social access, prop, ideal, bond, flaw, secret, enemy, owed debt, old reputation, and what the character does under pressure. Modernize dated labels and grammar. Keep the result playable: a background should create choices, obligations, invitations, shame, leverage, and trouble, not a static biography paragraph.',
    array[
