    'Character background taxonomy',
    'Turns ideals, bonds, flaws, props, and contacts into concise playable persona fields.',
    'For each background, capture five fields. Ideal: what the character claims matters. Bond: who or what can move them against self-interest. Flaw: the behavior that creates cost. Prop: the object, document, scar, token, tool, or habit that makes the history visible. Hook: the person, institution, debt, secret, case, rival, patient, lover, grave, law, or war memory that can walk into the story. Keep prose lean and observable.',
    array[
      'background-ideal-bond-flaw-matrix',
      'psych-character-flaw',
      'protagonist-flaw-pressure',
      'vocab-character-behavior-traits',
      'character-introduction-anchor-map'
