    'Occupation Origin Archetype Map',
    'occupation-origin-archetype-map',
    'Character archetypes',
    'Organizes occupation-based origins into bureaucracy, underworld, diplomacy, deathwork, healing, pleasure, justice, espionage, war, and horror witness categories.',
    'Build occupational origins from social function, not job title alone. Ask what the work trained into the body: quiet steps, perfect ledgers, courtroom speech, bedside calm, graveyard humor, coded listening, party charm, paperwork contempt, or reflexive threat scanning. Then ask what the work cost: empathy, sleep, innocence, shame, status, family, faith, freedom, or the ability to be ordinary.',
    array[
      'occupation-origin-archetype',
      'bureaucrat-accountant-seneschal',
      'underworld-boss-enforcer',
      'envoy-negotiator-patronage',
      'deathwork-grief-profession'
