  ),
  (
    'core-scandal-seduction-consequence-map',
    'Scandal Seduction Consequence Map',
    'scandal-seduction-consequence-map',
    'Relationship psychology',
    'Modernizes hedonist and seducer backgrounds into appetite, charm, entitlement, old harm, and repair possibility.',
    'Use hedonist and romantic-rover backgrounds through consequence, not glamour alone. Track appetite, boredom, generosity, debt, addiction risk, old lovers, children, vanity, insecurity, and the trail of people who remember the character differently than they remember themself. The modern version can be magnetic and funny, but the story should know who paid for the charm and whether the character can face that bill.',
