    'core-mind-body-brain-emotion-sexuality-map',
    'Mind Body Brain Emotion Sexuality Map',
    'mind-body-brain-emotion-sexuality-map',
    'Psychosexual model taxonomy',
    'Separates four sexuality layers while preserving their feedback loops.',
    'Map sexuality across four lenses. Mind: beliefs, values, language, fantasy, choice, and inner critic. Body: anatomy, sensation, breath, pain, pleasure, fertility, and body image. Brain: reflex, arousal, memory, attachment circuits, anticipation, and reward. Emotion: shame, fear, longing, grief, tenderness, anger, intuition, and repair. When a scene stalls, ask which layer is blocking the others. When a scene opens, ask which layer gave permission first.',
    array[
