  ),
  (
    'core-safer-sex-education-context-map',
    'Safer Sex Education Context Map',
    'safer-sex-education-context-map',
    'Sexual health taxonomy',
    'Routes safer-sex education into prevention, disclosure, testing, contraception, and current-guidance referral context.',
    'Use safer-sex education as context, not improvised medical advice. Store buckets: contraception, condoms/barriers, STI testing, disclosure, symptom anxiety, fertility awareness, pregnancy prevention, abortion context, health appointments, partner communication, and choices after risk. In fiction, safer-sex details can carry trust: who plans, who avoids, who checks, who tells the truth. In user-facing support, verify current medical guidance and route health concerns to qualified care.',
    array[
