    'Pouncing happens when interest outruns knowledge. Signals: constant calls, rapid intimacy claims, excessive compliments, instant availability, emotional dumping, future-faking, needing reassurance from a stranger, and taking polite attention as commitment. In modern scenes, overinvestment can be tender, embarrassing, manipulative, or unsafe depending on impact. Repair path: slow down, regain self-respect, ask rather than flood, accept distance, and let attraction grow through real information.',
    array[
