    'Pelvic-Floor Control Claim Caveat',
    'pelvic-floor-control-claim-caveat',
    'Health caveat taxonomy',
    'Keeps pelvic-floor and sexual-control claims separate from verified medical guidance.',
    'Route pelvic-floor control claims with care. For fiction, the material can inform body awareness, practice frustration, soreness, pride, focus, breath, and a character learning that his body does not obey like a machine. For real-world questions, do not improvise a training protocol from this source. Flag soreness, pain, numbness, injury, medication effects, erectile concerns, pelvic pain, ejaculation concerns, and STI or pregnancy risk as health-context material that belongs with qualified medical advice and current guidance.',
    array[
