    'Heteronormative Performance Belief Router',
    'heteronormative-performance-belief-router',
    'Belief-source taxonomy',
    'Stores lasting-longer, gendered satisfaction, and penetration-centered claims as worldview material rather than truth.',
    'Treat gendered performance claims as character-belief fuel. A character may believe that lasting longer proves masculinity, that penetration is the main event, that a partner''s orgasm is his report card, or that sexual skill will secure love. The taxonomy should not endorse those beliefs. Route them into insecurity, pride, pressure, avoidance, tenderness, miscommunication, status anxiety, or repair. Modernize the language: partners are not trophies, proof, or training equipment; sex is shared experience shaped by bodies, consent, context, and meaning.',
    array[
