    'princess-pillowfighter-rpg-source-router',
    'Game design taxonomy',
    'Routes the Princess Pillowfighter source into soft-conflict RPG design, whimsical estate politics, social resources, and NPC generation.',
    'Use this source as playful game-design material, not as realistic combat logic. Its useful seed pattern is a world where ambition matters but harm is softened: princesses maneuver for estates, status, allies, and attention; conflict is abstracted through ritual contest; loss changes confidence, reputation, access, or leverage rather than producing gore. Keep the tone quick, sharp, and readable: bright courtly pressure, comic embarrassment, real stakes inside a deliberately gentle frame.',
    array[
