      'theme-motif-symbol-engine',
      'theme-power-control'
    ],
    array['JanitorAI', 'SillyTavern', 'MarinaraTavern']
  ),
  (
    'core-princess-npc-generator-map',
    'Princess NPC Generator Map',
    'princess-npc-generator-map',
    'Character design taxonomy',
    'Turns appearance rolls and mechanical differences into distinct NPC princesses with social style and story pressure.',
    'Generate princess NPCs from three linked layers: visible signal, social engine, and playable weakness. Visible signal covers silhouette, hair, clothing colors, accessories, face, mannerism, and reputation. Social engine covers what she wants from the room: admiration, safety, obedience, novelty, revenge, friendship, proof, or escape. Playable weakness is the trait that can be pressured in a contest or conversation. Do not stop at appearance; let the unusual feature imply how people misread her and how she uses that misreading.',
