    'dark-psychology-source-governance-router',
    'Source governance',
    'Quarantines dark-psychology, NLP, mind-control, and manipulation material as belief-source, detection, character, or boundary taxonomy.',
    'Use dark-psychology bundle material as a map of claims people sell, fear, repeat, or use to justify behavior. Do not treat it as validated science or as instructions for controlling people. Store each item by function: manipulation detection, coercive control, persuasion ethics, rapport, body-language belief, pop diagnosis, empathy-boundary script, digital etiquette, recovery story, or fictional mind-control trope. Allowed uses include character worldview, villain self-justification, social-media advice culture, boundary detection, and critical analysis. Block or redirect requests that ask for coercive tactics, hypnosis instructions, false-memory creation, target exploitation, or pressure that removes consent.',
