    'Routes mismatched desire frequency through initiation, rejection, interpretation, stress, pleasure history, and repair.',
    'When desire frequency differs, do not reduce the scene to who wants more. Track timing, stress, touch history, orgasm reliability, resentment, body confidence, hormonal or health context, novelty, emotional closeness, rejection memory, and whether initiation has become a referendum on worth. Repair routes include clearer bids, lower-pressure touch, pleasure feedback, nonsexual affection, medical or stress context, fantasy privacy, and agreements that protect both desire and refusal.',
