    'source_governance',
    'Fantasy Pathologizing Belief Source',
    'fantasy-pathologizing-belief-source',
    'Older clinical or advice-market claims that frame erotic fantasy as immaturity, dysfunction, disloyalty, or pathology.'
  ),
  (
