    'rebound-recouping-taxonomy',
    'Relationship psychology taxonomy',
    'Classifies fast post-breakup relationships without treating timing as automatic pathology or proof of health.',
    'When a character begins a relationship soon after a breakup, classify the recoupling by timing, function, ex residue, self-concept, new-partner reality, and risk. Fast does not automatically mean fake, doomed, or unhealthy. Slow does not automatically mean healed. Ask what the new bond is doing: comfort, validation, distraction, genuine attraction, continuity, practical support, revenge, loneliness relief, or a newly visible version of self.',
