    'Treat a gendered dating primer as a belief-source artifact. Keep: safety awareness, listening practice, specific appreciation, clean rejection, jealousy warning signs, hidden-agenda detection, communication repair, and the fact that people carry real risk calculations into dating. Quarantine: all women/all men claims, provider destiny, status worship, sexual entitlement, gender tests, dominance as default, women as a category to manage, and advice that treats discomfort as proof of attraction.',
