    'Green-flag traits should become story behavior. Intelligence appears as curiosity, memory, flexible thinking, and good questions. Confidence appears as direct asking, accepting praise, steady posture, and willingness to try. Creativity appears as play, imagination, suggestive language, art, roleplay, and original solutions. Ambition appears as purpose, self-respect, discipline, and chosen growth. Enthusiasm appears as warmth, laughter, appetite for life, and responsive presence. Do not make any trait compulsory for worth. Use the map to build attraction, compatibility, contrast, or believable mismatch.',
