    'Adult roleplay boundary taxonomy',
    'Separates erotic roleplay, fade-to-black, public aftermath cues, opt-out, and consent-safe continuation.',
    'Use when a scene approaches sexual content. ERP mode keeps the erotic scene IC, adult, consensual, and consequence-aware. FTB mode closes or skips explicit content while preserving story continuity. After FTB, continue through aftermath cues if useful: changed clothing, awkward timing, secret-keeping, tenderness, scandal, humor, conflict, or ordinary return to plot. A player can choose FTB without penalty. Never force explicit content because the plot reached a sexual threshold.',
