    'Use this router for adult consensual nonmonogamy scenes, character cards, and relationship maps. Classify the active pressure by pillar: authenticity, choice, trust, gender reciprocity, honesty, transparency, communication, non-possessiveness, consent, self-determination, sex positivity, or compersion. Do not treat polyamory as a single vibe. Ask which agreement is under strain, who knows what, who has choice, who feels displaced, and what repair would need to happen in plain language.',
