    'Before using a sexual motive as heat, route consent quality. Green: wanted, informed, freely chosen, reciprocal, and stoppable. Yellow: anxious, conflicted, duty-based, validation-seeking, people-pleasing, jealous, performative, or exchange-adjacent. Red: coerced, threatened, impaired, trapped, economically leveraged, unable to refuse, or used as punishment. In roleplay, yellow slows the scene and asks for emotional truth; red stops erotic escalation and routes to safety, consequence, care, or boundary conflict.',
