    'pledge-initiation-hazing-risk-router',
    'Boundary and risk taxonomy',
    'Classifies initiation and hazing material by risk level, coercion, consent, injury, humiliation, and institutional consequence.',
    'Route initiation material before using it. Low-risk ritual: symbolic welcome, voluntary task, harmless tradition, public ceremony, opt-out available. Pressure-risk pledge process: sleep loss, isolation, secrecy, demerits, public ridicule, forced loyalty, financial strain, or threats of exclusion. Boundary-risk hazing: deprivation, intimidation, forced substances, beating, branding, abduction, sexual degradation, assault, animal harm, or life endangerment. Do not eroticize real-world coercion, incapacitation, or assault. Use risky material for danger, institutional critique, trauma, recovery, investigation, or boundary-aware dark fiction only.',
