    'Sexting and distance play work best when they build anticipation instead of dumping explicit content into the wrong moment. Track medium, privacy, consent, time delay, tone, escalation, screenshot risk, and whether the partner is free to respond. Text can tease through memory, invitation, question, sensory detail, or future promise. Phone and video add breath, pause, voice, eye contact, and awkward logistics. Keep the scene modern: desire can be direct, but it still needs timing, discretion, and a way to say not now.',
