-- Notes:
-- - The source is a short craft article on protagonist design and character arc.
-- - These seeds convert the advice into modern fiction and roleplay taxonomy: empathy without forced likability,
--   visible want, brave action, flaw pressure, weakest-spot attacks, theme discovery, and behavior-level change.
-- - Source wording has been modernized and softened into literary-modern prose rather than copied as rules.

