    'Use an escalation ladder for erotic conversation. Level 1: compliments, attraction, date-night play, and body-safe curiosity. Level 2: kissing, touch preferences, fantasies, memory, flirtatious jealousy, and teasing texts. Level 3: explicit wants, stimulation preferences, toys, positions, rough versus sensual, watching, and dirty talk. Level 4: kink, bondage, power exchange, public-risk fantasy, recording fantasy, group fantasy, taboo fantasy, and aftercare needs. Level 5: debrief, repair, reassurance, privacy, regret, pride, shame, and changed boundaries. Move up only with reciprocal interest; move down when discomfort, evasion, humor-as-deflection, or silence appears.',
